<title>USA: IMF optimistic Italy can meet Maastricht criteria.</title>
<headline>IMF optimistic Italy can meet Maastricht criteria.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flemming Larsen, Deputy Director at the IMF's Research Department, said Wednesday he was encouraged by progress Italy has made in reining its its bloated budget.</p>
<p>&quot;We are quite optimistic about Italy's medium-term outlook and scope for eventually meeting the (Maastricht) convergence criteria,&quot; Larsen told reporters at the start of the IMF semi-annual meeting.</p>
<p>But he added that it was difficult to predict precisely when that would occur, because of lack of full information on Italy's budget.</p>
</text>
